Keep a shared dp as an empty list of whole numbers.
For every spot from 0 to 12.
Place 0 into dp.

Keep a shared best as 0.

To test from value (a whole number) with step (a whole number).
The square is step times step.
If square is more than value, return.
The trial is item (value minus square) of dp plus 1.
If trial is less than best, set best to trial.
Test from value with step plus 1.

The number is 12.
For every value from 1 to 12.
Set best to 1000000.
Test from value with 1.
Set item value of dp to best.

Show item 12 of dp.
